 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Booking conflict detection now covers every overlap, not only the ones
+  starting inside an existing booking.
+- Bookings are refused when the period is empty or inverted, when the room or
+  the user does not exist, and when an instant is not ISO-8601.
+- Updates to a booking go through the same validation as creation.
+- The conflict check and the write it guards share a transaction, so two
+  concurrent requests for the same slot can no longer both succeed.
+
 ## 1.0.0
 
 - Rooms, users, bookings and amenities endpoints.
